                          line 48 14616 344 20 base 14
                            text "On 14 February 2011, the W3C extended the charter of" 48 14618 332 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14636 344 20 base 14
                            text "its HTML Working Group with clear milestones for" 48 14638 316 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14656 344 20 base 14
                            text "HTML5. In May 2011, the working group advanced" 48 14658 320 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14676 344 20 base 14
                            text "HTML5 to \"Last Call\", an invitation to communities" 48 14678 328 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14696 344 20 base 14
                            text "inside and outside W3C to confirm the technical" 48 14698 308 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14716 344 20 base 14
                            text "soundness of the specification. The W3C developed" 48 14718 336 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14736 344 20 base 14
                            text "a comprehensive test suite to achieve broad" 48 14738 288 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14756 344 20 base 14
                            text "interoperability for the full specification by 2014," 48 14758 308 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14776 344 20 base 14
