                          line 48 14896 344 20 base 14
                            text "of separation. W3C will continue the HTML5" 48 14898 280 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14916 344 20 base 14
                            text "specification work, focusing on a single definitive" 48 14918 324 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14936 344 20 base 14
                            text "standard, which is considered a \"snapshot\" by" 48 14938 308 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14956 344 20 base 14
                            text "WHATWG. The WHATWG organization will continue its" 48 14958 340 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14976 344 20 base 14
                            text "work with HTML5 as a \"Living Standard\". The" 48 14978 296 16 serif 16
                          line 48 14996 344 20 base 14
